### TITLE ###
MovingDownThenSubmitting
### DESCRIPTION ###
The cursor marks one option at a time, and submitting collapses the prompt to a
one-line summary of what was chosen.
### PROMPT ###
Pick a fruit
### OPTIONS ###
Apple
Banana
Cherry
### KEYS ###
down
enter
### SELECTED ###
Banana
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
Pick a fruit
> Apple
  Banana
  Cherry
--- frame 1 (down) ---
Pick a fruit
  Apple
> Banana
  Cherry
--- frame 2 (enter) ---
Pick a fruit Banana

### TITLE ###
EndThenHomeReturnsToTheTop
### DESCRIPTION ###
End jumps to the last option and Home back to the first, so the two cancel out.
### PROMPT ###
Pick
### OPTIONS ###
a
b
c
d
### KEYS ###
down
down
end
home
enter
### SELECTED ###
a
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
Pick
> a
  b
  c
  d
--- frame 1 (down) ---
Pick
  a
> b
  c
  d
--- frame 2 (down) ---
Pick
  a
  b
> c
  d
--- frame 3 (end) ---
Pick
  a
  b
  c
> d
--- frame 4 (home) ---
Pick
> a
  b
  c
  d
--- frame 5 (enter) ---
Pick a

### TITLE ###
PageDownMovesAWholePage
### DESCRIPTION ###
With height 3, one PageDown moves the cursor three options rather than one.
### PROMPT ###
Pick
### OPTIONS ###
o1
o2
o3
o4
o5
o6
o7
o8
### HEIGHT ###
3
### KEYS ###
page-down
enter
### SELECTED ###
o4
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
Pick
> o1
  o2
  o3
  ↓ 5 more
--- frame 1 (page-down) ---
Pick
  ↑ 1 more
  o2
  o3
> o4
  ↓ 4 more
--- frame 2 (enter) ---
Pick o4

### TITLE ###
PageDownClampsAtTheLastOption
### DESCRIPTION ###
Paging past the end stops at the last option instead of wrapping, so three
PageDowns land on o8 and one PageUp steps back to o5.
### PROMPT ###
Pick
### OPTIONS ###
o1
o2
o3
o4
o5
o6
o7
o8
### HEIGHT ###
3
### KEYS ###
page-down
page-down
page-down
page-up
enter
### SELECTED ###
o5
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
Pick
> o1
  o2
  o3
  ↓ 5 more
--- frame 1 (page-down) ---
Pick
  ↑ 1 more
  o2
  o3
> o4
  ↓ 4 more
--- frame 2 (page-down) ---
Pick
  ↑ 4 more
  o5
  o6
> o7
  ↓ 1 more
--- frame 3 (page-down) ---
Pick
  ↑ 5 more
  o6
  o7
> o8
--- frame 4 (page-up) ---
Pick
  ↑ 4 more
> o5
  o6
  o7
  ↓ 1 more
--- frame 5 (enter) ---
Pick o5

### TITLE ###
CancelLeavesNoSummary
### DESCRIPTION ###
Ctrl-C returns no selection, and the last frame is the interactive render: there
is no collapsed summary line to mislead a reader into thinking something was
chosen.
### PROMPT ###
Pick
### OPTIONS ###
Apple
Banana
### KEYS ###
down
ctrl-c
### SELECTED ###
<canceled>
### FRAMES ###
--- frame 0 (initial) ---
Pick
> Apple
  Banana
--- frame 1 (down) ---
Pick
  Apple
> Banana
